<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LARGELY UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES LARGELY UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor market interest rates</p>
<p>were largely unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Tuesday. The key three-month rate was steady at 3.40 percent.</p>
<p>				    August 27 fix	 August 26 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		    3.27 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		    3.34 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		    3.40 pct		3.40 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		    3.56 pct		3.55 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		    3.73 pct		3.70 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		   3.89 pct		3.87 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 248</p>
</text>
